===Etymology===
From historical {{m|ru|Бе́лая Русь||{{w|White Ruthenia}} or White Rus}}, from {{inh|ru|orv|Бѣла Роусь||{{w|White Ruthenia}} or White Rus}}. Cognate with {{cog|be|Белару́сь}}, later borrowed into Russian {{m|be|Белару́сь}} as an alternative name, now official. Compare with {{cog|uk|Білору́сія}} and {{m|uk|Білору́сь}}.

